  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your mythic power to fuel your elemental assaults.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Elemental Assault<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the additional rounds per day granted by Extra Elemental Assault. You may expend one use of mythic power as a move action before attacking with an elemental assault. If you succeed on the attack, add your mythic tier to the elemental damage dealt by the elemental assault.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-extra-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
